Subscription `a9049f9f` (Normain). These are the **genuine + lower-urgency config fixes** from the Defender posture review — the real ISO-relevant hardening, separate from the dependency-CVE findings (handled via the existing Trivy/Dependabot + nor-28xx bump flow) and from the items we're exempting.

**Status snapshot — 2026-06-30.** Secure score **36.16%** (9.04/25) — up from 15.48% on 2026-06-24 (more than doubled). Lane B findings 480 → **433** (47 cleared net). The network + Key Vault + Foundry + AKS-policy-add-on pass landed (the score-movers). Remaining ≈ AKS pod-security manifest work + quick wins + exemptions + finishing the partials.

